1. DEFINITIONS

"Software" means the Bobina application, its source code, bundled reference data
(including the colour and material lexicon) and accompanying documentation.

"Personal Use" means use by an individual for private purposes, learning,
research, evaluation, or for producing objects that are not sold, bartered or
otherwise exchanged for value.

"Commercial Use" means any use of the Software in connection with activity that
generates or is intended to generate revenue. This includes, without limitation,
using the Software to price, quote or invoice goods or services that are sold,
and use by or on behalf of a company, sole trader or other organisation in the
course of its business.

"Monthly Revenue" means the gross revenue of the licensee entity, from all
activities, in the calendar month concerned.


