3. COMMERCIAL USE

Commercial Use requires a separate written licence from the author, agreed in
advance. Commercial licences are offered on the following terms:

  (a) EUR 10 per month, for licensees whose Monthly Revenue does not
      exceed EUR 10,000.

  (b) EUR 100 per month, for licensees whose Monthly Revenue exceeds
      EUR 10,000.

Prices are per licensee entity and exclude any applicable taxes. The bracket is
assessed monthly; a licensee that crosses the threshold moves to bracket (b) for
the months in which the threshold is exceeded. The author may agree different
terms in writing for a particular licensee.

To obtain a commercial licence, contact the author before commercial use begins.
Continued Commercial Use without a licence terminates the rights granted by this
licence.


