5. REFERENCE DATA AND THIRD-PARTY SHOPS

The Software bundles a lexicon of brand, material, colour and format names used
in 3D printing. It is an aid to searching, not an authority: names are added by
hand, vary between manufacturers, and go out of date.

The Software can also read publicly available product listings from third-party
online shops in order to show prices. Those prices belong to the shops, are
gathered at the moment of the request, and are shown for information only. They
are not offers, they go stale, and a shop may change its site at any time and
break the reading of it. Verify any price on the shop's own site before relying
on it. The author does not warrant that any figure is accurate, current or fit
for any purpose, and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or acting on behalf of
any shop named in the Software. You are responsible for using the Software in a
way that respects the terms of service and the technical limits of any site it
contacts.


